        "kind": "statement",
        "source": {
          "commit": "83baa43225cd9a5f9684a0481b8502b6004fa49c",
          "embedded_as": null,
          "lines": "250-264",
          "locator": "aero/provenance/four_fold.py",
          "role": "code",
          "sha256": null
        },
        "text": "container_sif_sha256 is looked up by SIF basename in containers/SHA256SUMS at run time; the SIF that actually ran was not re-hashed (review item P1c)."
      },
      {
        "id": "input-uq-skipped",
        "kind": "statement",
        "source": {
          "commit": "83baa43225cd9a5f9684a0481b8502b6004fa49c",
          "embedded_as": null,
          "lines": "144-156",
          "locator": "aero/vv/reportable.py",
          "role": "code",
          "sha256": null
        },
        "text": "No input (parametric) uncertainty quantification was performed: u95_input is 0 with basis 'skipped', so U95 here is numerical (+ statistical where stated) only."
      },
      {
        "id": "no-experiment-anchor",
        "kind": "statement",
        "source": {
          "commit": null,
          "embedded_as": "evidence/stage15_optimization.json",
          "lines": null,
          "locator": "data/vv/stage15_optimization.json",
          "role": "source-record",
          "sha256": "09ff2dbcd662a0da4cfa97df4e640f715a2f43b50fbc4565554bcf2b41caebc2"
        },
        "text": "The airfoil objective's forward model (k-omega SST, wall functions, Re 5e5) has no experiment anchor: anchors = [] in the record. Improvements are matched-condition CFD deltas, not validated absolute values."
      },
      {
        "id": "not-flagship-domain",
        "kind": "statement",
        "source": {
          "commit": "83baa43225cd9a5f9684a0481b8502b6004fa49c",
          "embedded_as": null,
          "lines": "96-99",
          "locator": "docs/adrs/ADR-046-stage-21-rescope-release-first.md",
          "role": "adr",
          "sha256": null
        },
        "text": "This optimization is on the AIRFOIL case. The optimizer has never been run on a flapping-wing case. No flapping optimization claim is made in v0.1.0."
      },
      {
        "id": "nogo",
        "kind": "statement",
        "source": {
          "commit": null,
          "embedded_as": "evidence/stage15_optimization.json",
          "lines": null,
          "locator": "data/vv/stage15_optimization.json",
          "role": "source-record",
          "sha256": "09ff2dbcd662a0da4cfa97df4e640f715a2f43b50fbc4565554bcf2b41caebc2"
        },
        "text": "NO-GO: the optimum's matched delta 24.66 did NOT exceed even its own U95 of 25.37 (the gated bar is 2 x U95 = 50.75). The family is not grid-converged (observed order -1.10). The +113.8 % baseline-to-optimum change is NOT an improvement claim."
      },
      {
        "id": "retracted-claim",
        "kind": "statement",
        "source": {
          "commit": "83baa43225cd9a5f9684a0481b8502b6004fa49c",
          "embedded_as": null,
          "lines": "278-282",
          "locator": "CHANGELOG.md",
          "role": "handoff",
          "sha256": null
        },
        "text": "An earlier draft claimed a '+47 % thesis-grade CFD-verified improvement'. It was withdrawn after an adversarial audit and a 3-grid observed-order V&V refuted it."
      },
      {
        "id": "diagnostic-not-gate",
        "kind": "statement",
        "source": {
          "commit": null,
